guJ(){return"Elternzeit letter to the employer"},
guK(){return"The last pages hold a template for each parent with an employer, filled from your plan: the periods are your months with Elterngeld. Add names and addresses, change what does not fit, and send it. You request Elternzeit in text form, as a letter or an e-mail, at least seven weeks before it starts, and state at the same time for which periods within two years you take it. Each parent can split it into three sections, more with the employer's consent (\xa7\xa016 Abs. 1 BEEG)."},
